          "text": "The Importance of Early Detection",
          "html": "The Importance of Early Detection",
          "align": "center",
          "id": "CC8IbSVLLu",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Many <a href=\"/eye-care-services/dry-eye-treatment/\">eye conditions</a> develop slowly and may not have obvious symptoms at first. That means your vision can change before you even realize something’s wrong. With regular eye exams, our eye doctors can detect small changes early and track them over time. The earlier we catch something, the more we can do to protect your vision and keep things from progressing.</p>",
          "align": "center",
          "id": "NLuw7V975U",
