          "html": "<p>If something shows up during your eye exam, we don’t just hand you information and send you on your way. We take the time to explain what’s going on, what it means, and what the next steps look like.</p><p>From ongoing monitoring to treatment plans, we stay involved and make sure you always feel supported. It’s a more personal, more thoughtful way to take care of your eye health.</p>",
          "id": "gvTjRNK0or",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
