          "level": 2,
          "text": "Ocular Diseases We Manage",
          "html": "Ocular Diseases We Manage",
          "id": "6YenxPf7ms",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Glaucoma</h3><p>Glaucoma affects the optic nerve, often due to increased pressure in the eye. It usually develops without noticeable symptoms early on, which is why routine monitoring is so important. We keep a close watch and help manage the condition to protect your vision.</p><h3>Macular Degeneration</h3><p>Macular degeneration affects your central vision, which is what you rely on for reading, driving, and recognizing faces. It’s more common as we get older, but with regular eye exams, we can detect early signs and help you maintain your quality of life.</p>",
          "id": "GEPBmfa0c6",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        }
      ]
    },
