        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Diabetic Eye Disease</h3><p>If you have diabetes, your eyes need a little extra attention. Changes in blood sugar can affect the small blood vessels in your eyes, sometimes without symptoms. Routine diabetic eye exams help us monitor those changes and step in if needed.</p><h3>Cataracts</h3><p>Cataracts cause the natural lens of your eye to become cloudy over time, leading to blurred or dim vision. We monitor their progression and, when the time is right, coordinate with New Jersey&nbsp;eye surgeons to make sure you receive expert care before and after surgery.</p>",
          "id": "rzeJspS5MD",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
